    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Brawl of America, the wackiest physics-based brawler where chaos reigns supreme! Dive into frenetic battles where everything and everyone is a weapon. From chairs and tables to your fellow brawlers, if you can pick it up, you can throw it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Physics-Based Combat:</strong></h2> Experience unpredictable and hilarious combat where every object and character reacts with wild, ragdoll physics.<br><br>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/8f3bd9ade0322fcfb97c7b2fbae84e49.poster.avif?t=1717426867\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/8f3bd9ade0322fcfb97c7b2fbae84e49.webm?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/8f3bd9ade0322fcfb97c7b2fbae84e49.mp4?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Maps:</strong></h2> Battle in a wide range of environments, each filled with interactive elements to turn the tide of combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/f640ac2cd78e3090997715eaa2027d07.poster.avif?t=1717426867\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/f640ac2cd78e3090997715eaa2027d07.webm?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/f640ac2cd78e3090997715eaa2027d07.mp4?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong></h2> Fight against friends or foes in online multiplayer matches that promise endless fun and laughter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/a44ee5f72926a3911a6632753913bcc6.poster.avif?t=1717426867\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/a44ee5f72926a3911a6632753913bcc6.webm?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/a44ee5f72926a3911a6632753913bcc6.mp4?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of Game Modes:</strong></h2> Test your brawling skills across multiple game modes, each offering a unique twist on the classic brawl.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/554c411531b3d09e1f6d71c31c574679.poster.avif?t=1717426867\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/554c411531b3d09e1f6d71c31c574679.webm?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010100/extras/554c411531b3d09e1f6d71c31c574679.mp4?t=1717426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gear up and get ready to brawl in the most outrageous fight of your life. Brawl of America \u2013 where everything (and everyone) is a weapon!",
